(395313, 33406, 10643, '<td valign="top">beautiful old camera, and in such great shape. I''m jealous :)</td>', 'beautiful old camera, and in such great shape. I''m jealous :)', '2003-08-21 01:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(395318, 34474, 10643, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely. The pictures of the kids and grandkids on the walls and everything. I wish we had the angle where we could see her face in the mirror, but all in all an excellent and emotional photo.</td>', 'This is just lovely. The pictures of the kids and grandkids on the walls and everything. I wish we had the angle where we could see her face in the mirror, but all in all an excellent and emotional photo.', '2003-08-21 01:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(395325, 34476, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The light and composition are perfect. The reflection on the water is a eye catcher. I wish you luck this week !</td>', 'Beautiful. The light and composition are perfect. The reflection on the water is a eye catcher. I wish you luck this week !', '2003-08-21 01:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(395328, 34431, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich color and tones. Composition is good and the subject fits the challenge and is interesting. Nicely done !</td>', 'Beautiful rich color and tones. Composition is good and the subject fits the challenge and is interesting. Nicely done !', '2003-08-21 01:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(395330, 34261, 10275, '<td valign="top">this has hystorical meaning to me, since I am from former Czechoslovakia. What a treasure. The image itself looks a little bit horizontally distorted... did you use a special lens?</td>', 'this has hystorical meaning to me, since I am from former Czechoslovakia. What a treasure. The image itself looks a little bit horizontally distorted... did you use a special lens?', '2003-08-21 01:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(395331, 34281, 92, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of photos in a childrens bible. Beautiful tones and colors. This is so well done.</td>', 'This reminds me of photos in a childrens bible. Beautiful tones and colors. This is so well done.', '2003-08-21 01:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(395332, 33761, 9146, '<td valign="top">I don''t see anything in the pic....you should know that thr last 3 degrese arnt cleart on my monitor so it might be me...but you should be prepared for a long week....I did''nt vote on your pic BTW....good luck</td>', 'I don''t see anything in the pic....you should know that thr last 3 degrese arnt cleart on my monitor so it might be me...but you should be prepared for a long week....I did''nt vote on your pic BTW....good luck', '2003-08-21 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(395336, 34434, 92, '<td valign="top">Great subject with beautiful colors. The hills in the background and old barn and fence really add to the wagon and cowboy feel of this. Nice find !</td>', 'Great subject with beautiful colors. The hills in the background and old barn and fence really add to the wagon and cowboy feel of this. Nice find !', '2003-08-21 01:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(395338, 34120, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. The reflection on the water really adds to the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. The reflection on the water really adds to the photo.', '2003-08-21 01:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(395356, 34483, 6405, '<td valign="top">nice subject,bad lighting !</td>', 'nice subject,bad lighting !', '2003-08-21 02:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(395396, 34474, 7763, '<td valign="top">what a sweet picture :) nicey done</td>', 'what a sweet picture :) nicey done', '2003-08-21 23:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(395398, 34092, 10414, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhhhh!!!!!!    :)   10+</td>', 'Ahhhhhhhh!!!!!!    :)   10+', '2003-08-21 23:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(395399, 33656, 472, '<td valign="top">richly evokes the past!!!  it''s amazing!!!  was this a set?!?!?!  only gripe - a little dark in the foreground. i''d also like to see people in the scene. great shot!</td>', 'richly evokes the past!!!  it''s amazing!!!  was this a set?!?!?!  only gripe - a little dark in the foreground. i''d also like to see people in the scene. great shot!', '2003-08-21 23:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(395402, 33739, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the sky a lot, but he lighting on the ruins is dark and flat. Since the ruins are the subject I''d prefer to see the exposure, lighting, and color compliment them more. The whole picture feels very red.</td>', 'I like the sky a lot, but he lighting on the ruins is dark and flat. Since the ruins are the subject I''d prefer to see the exposure, lighting, and color compliment them more. The whole picture feels very red.', '2003-08-21 23:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(395403, 33735, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not a bad subject but if you could have zoomed in a bit more and made the window more prominent in the shot I Think it would have helped.</td>', 'Not a bad subject but if you could have zoomed in a bit more and made the window more prominent in the shot I Think it would have helped.', '2003-08-21 23:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(395405, 33709, 3554, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge, I like the angle of the roof against the sky. The barn feels a bit soft to me...actually maybe it\''s the whole picture. Not sure what your focal point was.</td>', 'Meets challenge, I like the angle of the roof against the sky. The barn feels a bit soft to me...actually maybe it\''s the whole picture. Not sure what your focal point was.', '2003-08-21 23:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(395408, 33624, 3306, '<td valign="top">well done. 9</td>', 'well done. 9', '2003-08-21 23:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(395409, 34467, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very sentimental. Nice. 8</td>', 'Very sentimental. Nice. 8', '2003-08-21 23:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
