(395419, 34281, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand the clothing (it looks like they are in bathrobes) Actually I think it''s the greenish robe that''s throwing me off. If it were just the young girl in the shot I think this would have been a lot better. Surroundings certainly meet the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand the clothing (it looks like they are in bathrobes) Actually I think it''s the greenish robe that''s throwing me off. If it were just the young girl in the shot I think this would have been a lot better. Surroundings certainly meet the challenge.', '2003-08-21 23:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(395423, 34467, 3554, '<td valign="top">Effective soft lighting.</td>', 'Effective soft lighting.', '2003-08-21 23:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(395427, 34488, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be stronger if you had gotten rid of the different electrical cords in the background. Otherwise great subjects for this challenge.</td>', 'I think this shot would be stronger if you had gotten rid of the different electrical cords in the background. Otherwise great subjects for this challenge.', '2003-08-21 23:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(395428, 33579, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, focus. I don''t really care for the tones here, maybe a true b&amp;w?<br/>Good work, good eye.</td>', 'Nice composition, focus. I don''t really care for the tones here, maybe a true b&w?Good work, good eye.', '2003-08-21 23:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(395429, 34153, 327, '<td valign="top">Artistically shot, well done. Interesting to the eye.</td>', 'Artistically shot, well done. Interesting to the eye.', '2003-08-21 23:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(395430, 34506, 3554, '<td valign="top">The park in the background is distracting, too busy. I think if you had cropped it just above the menu on the far table you''d have a more purposeful shot.  <br/> <br/>edit:  Oops forgot we couldn''t crop, but if you''d framed the picture differently in the camera it would have helped. Might have been tough with the post production limitations.</td>', 'The park in the background is distracting, too busy. I think if you had cropped it just above the menu on the far table you''d have a more purposeful shot.   edit:  Oops forgot we couldn''t crop, but if you''d framed the picture differently in the camera it would have helped. Might have been tough with the post production limitations.', '2003-08-21 23:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(395431, 34469, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, focus is a bit weak, but the colors are super as is the composition. Nicely done.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, focus is a bit weak, but the colors are super as is the composition. Nicely done.', '2003-08-21 23:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(395432, 33739, 327, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting....fantastic colors. Nice work.</td>', 'Amazing lighting....fantastic colors. Nice work.', '2003-08-21 23:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(395433, 34498, 327, '<td valign="top">This is nice. I love the composition. I think this shot would of benefited from some levels adjustment/burn tool. :) Good shooting.</td>', 'This is nice. I love the composition. I think this shot would of benefited from some levels adjustment/burn tool. :) Good shooting.', '2003-08-22 00:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(395434, 34476, 327, '<td valign="top">Good color, light, focus and composition.</td>', 'Good color, light, focus and composition.', '2003-08-22 00:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
