(395440, 33624, 327, '<td valign="top">Just fantastic......I love it all...light, tones, composition, focus. Nice, nice, nice.</td>', 'Just fantastic......I love it all...light, tones, composition, focus. Nice, nice, nice.', '2003-08-22 00:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(395442, 34504, 327, '<td valign="top">Marvelous.....good tone, light, focus is super.</td>', 'Marvelous.....good tone, light, focus is super.', '2003-08-22 00:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(395443, 34340, 327, '<td valign="top">No not a H1 or H2, but a darn good clear, clean shot.</td>', 'No not a H1 or H2, but a darn good clear, clean shot.', '2003-08-22 00:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(395444, 33656, 327, '<td valign="top">Really an inviting shot, makes the viewer want to walk in and sit down. Great light [natural] and good soft color. Well done.</td>', 'Really an inviting shot, makes the viewer want to walk in and sit down. Great light [natural] and good soft color. Well done.', '2003-08-22 00:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(395446, 34489, 327, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot. Love the subject and the composition. Nice work my friend.</td>', 'Outstanding shot. Love the subject and the composition. Nice work my friend.', '2003-08-22 00:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(395448, 34484, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, model, color and light.</td>', 'Nice composition, model, color and light.', '2003-08-22 00:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(395451, 34467, 327, '<td valign="top">Shot well, but I think the focus is a little soft. Still I do like this, the colors are very appealing.</td>', 'Shot well, but I think the focus is a little soft. Still I do like this, the colors are very appealing.', '2003-08-22 00:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(395453, 34447, 327, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. The texture, colors and focus are luscious. Good work my friend, good eye for details. Well done.</td>', 'Love this shot. The texture, colors and focus are luscious. Good work my friend, good eye for details. Well done.', '2003-08-22 00:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(395454, 34483, 11134, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and I would have liked to have given you higher marks.  However, because of the general fuzziness of the image, I must lower the rating.  A tripod would have probably solved this problem.  Also, a little more light would improve it dramatically, in my opinion</td>', 'Good idea, and I would have liked to have given you higher marks.  However, because of the general fuzziness of the image, I must lower the rating.  A tripod would have probably solved this problem.  Also, a little more light would improve it dramatically, in my opinion', '2003-08-22 00:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(395455, 34435, 11134, '<td valign="top">Good composition, good use of colors, nice perspective.  Unfortunately the picture gives a sense of being off balance because of the white pole on the right.  Good job.</td>', 'Good composition, good use of colors, nice perspective.  Unfortunately the picture gives a sense of being off balance because of the white pole on the right.  Good job.', '2003-08-22 00:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(395456, 33684, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, nice composition. I think a little too dark, but then.....my monitor may be wanky! Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot, nice composition. I think a little too dark, but then.....my monitor may be wanky! Good job.', '2003-08-22 00:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(395457, 33581, 11134, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but i don''t know if the light table or whatever it is that you used was the most effective source of light for this picture</td>', 'Good idea, but i don''t know if the light table or whatever it is that you used was the most effective source of light for this picture', '2003-08-22 00:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(395458, 34184, 327, '<td valign="top">Mine also. Native American Pride!!!!!!! Nice shot.</td>', 'Mine also. Native American Pride!!!!!!! Nice shot.', '2003-08-22 00:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(395459, 33739, 11134, '<td valign="top">this fits the challenge very well, and you choice of subject and time of day were very good.</td>', 'this fits the challenge very well, and you choice of subject and time of day were very good.', '2003-08-22 00:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(395460, 33590, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. I only would of liked the top 1/3 trimmed off. Good shot, good clear, clean shooting.</td>', 'I like this very much. I only would of liked the top 1/3 trimmed off. Good shot, good clear, clean shooting.', '2003-08-22 00:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(395461, 33427, 11134, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... I wish there had been a way to reduce glare from the windowpanes.  Maybe a different time of day?</td>', 'Hmmmm... I wish there had been a way to reduce glare from the windowpanes.  Maybe a different time of day?', '2003-08-22 00:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(395462, 34092, 327, '<td valign="top">Perfect angel, lovely lighting, tones.</td>', 'Perfect angel, lovely lighting, tones.', '2003-08-22 00:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(395463, 34434, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully shot, great colors, light, focus.</td>', 'Wonderfully shot, great colors, light, focus.', '2003-08-22 00:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(395464, 33860, 327, '<td valign="top">My personaly favorites. I love the old HBC stories and tales. Love the blanket and have one just like it. Good shot, good model.</td>', 'My personaly favorites. I love the old HBC stories and tales. Love the blanket and have one just like it. Good shot, good model.', '2003-08-22 00:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(395465, 34463, 11134, '<td valign="top">Ouch... I really like the idea and the colors... but the placement of the matchstick, cigarette, and penny does not work.  I think this would have been much better if the matchstick and cigarette''s paths created an intersecting line</td>', 'Ouch... I really like the idea and the colors... but the placement of the matchstick, cigarette, and penny does not work.  I think this would have been much better if the matchstick and cigarette''s paths created an intersecting line', '2003-08-22 00:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(395466, 34327, 11134, '<td valign="top">Fog effect is great, making for an outstanding picture.  For my tastes, though, I don''t feel as though this truly represents the past.</td>', 'Fog effect is great, making for an outstanding picture.  For my tastes, though, I don''t feel as though this truly represents the past.', '2003-08-22 00:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(395467, 34193, 327, '<td valign="top">Niiiiiiiiccccccee.</td>', 'Niiiiiiiiccccccee.', '2003-08-22 00:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(395468, 33815, 11134, '<td valign="top">Good picture, though I''m not one for the blatent statement of time.  Personally, I think this would have been a great idea if you had something else in it to convey the sense of time gone by</td>', 'Good picture, though I''m not one for the blatent statement of time.  Personally, I think this would have been a great idea if you had something else in it to convey the sense of time gone by', '2003-08-22 00:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(395469, 33501, 327, '<td valign="top">Hoop earrings, and pink lipstick...takes me back. Jackie-O glasses....lol<br/>Fun shot. Well done.</td>', 'Hoop earrings, and pink lipstick...takes me back. Jackie-O glasses....lolFun shot. Well done.', '2003-08-22 00:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(395470, 33761, 6900, '<td valign="top">At least you have no fear for the rest of your DPC life of ever achieving a personal low score. lol</td>', 'At least you have no fear for the rest of your DPC life of ever achieving a personal low score. lol', '2003-08-22 00:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(395472, 34498, 11134, '<td valign="top">Subject is too dead on for my tastes.  Baseball stands out to me, and I think it would look better if the baseball fit the rule of thirds</td>', 'Subject is too dead on for my tastes.  Baseball stands out to me, and I think it would look better if the baseball fit the rule of thirds', '2003-08-22 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(395473, 34105, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2003-08-22 00:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(395475, 33684, 11134, '<td valign="top">Windmill?  At any rate, good subject matter for the past, but I think it would have been a vast improvement to shoot this picture at an angle and to have the lines of the porch fade off into some sense of distance.  Basically, it feels rather flat.</td>', 'Windmill?  At any rate, good subject matter for the past, but I think it would have been a vast improvement to shoot this picture at an angle and to have the lines of the porch fade off into some sense of distance.  Basically, it feels rather flat.', '2003-08-22 00:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(395476, 33828, 11134, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Also effective in creating a personal sense of past from looking up at these statues as a little kid.  Good composition, and sunlight adds a whole new perspective to this shot.</td>', 'Very nice.  Also effective in creating a personal sense of past from looking up at these statues as a little kid.  Good composition, and sunlight adds a whole new perspective to this shot.', '2003-08-22 00:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(395477, 33709, 11134, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, to me, the barn itself isn''t really a strong enough subject on its own.  With something in the foreground other than trees, I think this would have been an effective picture</td>', 'Hmmmm, to me, the barn itself isn''t really a strong enough subject on its own.  With something in the foreground other than trees, I think this would have been an effective picture', '2003-08-22 00:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(395478, 33793, 11134, '<td valign="top">Ooooh...  I hate to say this, because it is a good picture, but I look at it as lost potential.  With all the lines in a canon and the fence right there, I think you should have tried a different angle with this.  Maybe from between the tall grass and looking up at the barrel... mayber through the spokes of the wheel... It would have jumped out at me then.  Good subject though, and nice composition.</td>', 'Ooooh...  I hate to say this, because it is a good picture, but I look at it as lost potential.  With all the lines in a canon and the fence right there, I think you should have tried a different angle with this.  Maybe from between the tall grass and looking up at the barrel... mayber through the spokes of the wheel... It would have jumped out at me then.  Good subject though, and nice composition.', '2003-08-22 00:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(395479, 33761, 2170, '<td valign="top">OK, I''ll admit it.  This made me laugh outloud.  Good gimmick.</td>', 'OK, I''ll admit it.  This made me laugh outloud.  Good gimmick.', '2003-08-22 00:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(395480, 33921, 2170, '<td valign="top">nice filtering!  the color is a bit pronounced, but otherwise a great shot.</td>', 'nice filtering!  the color is a bit pronounced, but otherwise a great shot.', '2003-08-22 00:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(395482, 33624, 2170, '<td valign="top">nicely captured motion.  i think i would have liked to see the entire shadow, but maybe that''s just me.</td>', 'nicely captured motion.  i think i would have liked to see the entire shadow, but maybe that''s just me.', '2003-08-22 00:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(395484, 34440, 2170, '<td valign="top">there needs to be more contrast here.  the subject blends into the background too much, unfortunately.</td>', 'there needs to be more contrast here.  the subject blends into the background too much, unfortunately.', '2003-08-22 00:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(395485, 33739, 10643, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites in this challenge. wonderful warm colors, like the sky is on fire. a really great subject and a beautiful picture!</td>', 'one of my favorites in this challenge. wonderful warm colors, like the sky is on fire. a really great subject and a beautiful picture!', '2003-08-22 00:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(395486, 33793, 2170, '<td valign="top">now, do you mean "cannon" the weapon, or "canon" the camera you took this photo with?  :)</td>', 'now, do you mean "cannon" the weapon, or "canon" the camera you took this photo with?  :)', '2003-08-22 00:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(395487, 33590, 10643, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites. gives another meaning to *depth* of field! lovely composition and a real sense of past and permanence. nice :)</td>', 'one of my favorites. gives another meaning to *depth* of field! lovely composition and a real sense of past and permanence. nice :)', '2003-08-22 00:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(395488, 33685, 10643, '<td valign="top">lots of character in this! nice job :)</td>', 'lots of character in this! nice job :)', '2003-08-22 00:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(395489, 33435, 2170, '<td valign="top">The guy on the front porch is the most interesting element in this photo and I almost missed him.  I would like to see some shots that are more focused on him.  Also, the "dead on" angle from which this was taken is not as interesting as a shot from an angle or different perspective would be.</td>', 'The guy on the front porch is the most interesting element in this photo and I almost missed him.  I would like to see some shots that are more focused on him.  Also, the "dead on" angle from which this was taken is not as interesting as a shot from an angle or different perspective would be.', '2003-08-22 00:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(395490, 34366, 2170, '<td valign="top">nicely framed.</td>', 'nicely framed.', '2003-08-22 00:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(395491, 34271, 2170, '<td valign="top">i can''t tell why this is the "past" other than the photo.  why not 1928?  ''52?  ''89?</td>', 'i can''t tell why this is the "past" other than the photo.  why not 1928?  ''52?  ''89?', '2003-08-22 00:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(395492, 34418, 2170, '<td valign="top">Color is washed out somewhat, but that definitely is an olde tractor.</td>', 'Color is washed out somewhat, but that definitely is an olde tractor.', '2003-08-22 00:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
