(395495, 34421, 2170, '<td valign="top">I like the way the sun is blocked out but the sunrays are still visible.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the way the sun is blocked out but the sunrays are still visible.  Well done.', '2003-08-22 00:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
