(395503, 34281, 11134, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''ve been disappointed with other submissions so far, so thank you for putting forth a strong effort.  The only suggestion I can make is to spread out the distance between the girls and the sack on the roof, so that the girls could be placed a little further to the right side of the shot.  Excellent photo, good luck.</td>', 'Wow, I''ve been disappointed with other submissions so far, so thank you for putting forth a strong effort.  The only suggestion I can make is to spread out the distance between the girls and the sack on the roof, so that the girls could be placed a little further to the right side of the shot.  Excellent photo, good luck.', '2003-08-22 00:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
