(395721, 34477, 6999, '<td valign="top">I can see the point with the DOF here, but I really don''t like the effect it gives: somehow it pulls my eye away from the obvious subject toward the out of focus lower left area - have no idea why that it, but it''s what happens. Can''t see a good reason for not having the entirety of the flag image in focus either. Not bad work, for all that.</td>', 'I can see the point with the DOF here, but I really don''t like the effect it gives: somehow it pulls my eye away from the obvious subject toward the out of focus lower left area - have no idea why that it, but it''s what happens. Can''t see a good reason for not having the entirety of the flag image in focus either. Not bad work, for all that.', '2003-08-22 06:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
