(395767, 34469, 8779, '<td valign="top">Over all, great pic. Was the black space on the left intensional?<br/> <br/>A difference version could be to fill the frame with just the shoes and as little black background as possible. So close that bits of the shoes are cropped off. I think that this version would increase interest.<br/> <br/>However, I still think that this is a great pic.</td>', 'Over all, great pic. Was the black space on the left intensional? A difference version could be to fill the frame with just the shoes and as little black background as possible. So close that bits of the shoes are cropped off. I think that this version would increase interest. However, I still think that this is a great pic.', '2003-08-22 08:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(395769, 33839, 7543, '<td valign="top">Flott mynd, frábært DOF, og lang besta túlkunin á þemainu sem ég hef séð hingað til. Vona að þessi fái borða. 9</td>', 'Flott mynd, frábært DOF, og lang besta túlkunin á þemainu sem ég hef séð hingað til. Vona að þessi fái borða. 9', '2003-08-22 08:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(395771, 34418, 8779, '<td valign="top">I love this truck. Immediately we know that this is a really old machine from the past.<br/> <br/>However, the sun got into the camera and has created this pale tinge across most of the picture and that red dot. Next time, perhaps you could angle you camera differently or put on a sunshade?<br/> <br/>I also feel that this great tractor is wasted from a plain side view. Next time, get a little more adventurous and experiment from lots of angles!</td>', 'I love this truck. Immediately we know that this is a really old machine from the past. However, the sun got into the camera and has created this pale tinge across most of the picture and that red dot. Next time, perhaps you could angle you camera differently or put on a sunshade? I also feel that this great tractor is wasted from a plain side view. Next time, get a little more adventurous and experiment from lots of angles!', '2003-08-22 08:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(395775, 34261, 8779, '<td valign="top">I may have this wrong, but have you done any illegal moves with software? Anyhow, it doesnt matter to me. <br/> <br/>But I''d just like to tell you that if it is digitally editted, it looks fake to me because:<br/>The letter looks a little ''unnatural'', like it''s been skewed too much [causing blur too]. <br/>I''m searching for the signs of a shadow.<br/>The exposers seem different, the ground dark and the letter very bright.<br/> <br/>Anyhow, the background is distracting and takes attention off the main subject, the letter. Also, the whole picture could be a little sharper perhaps?</td>', 'I may have this wrong, but have you done any illegal moves with software? Anyhow, it doesnt matter to me.  But I''d just like to tell you that if it is digitally editted, it looks fake to me because:The letter looks a little ''unnatural'', like it''s been skewed too much [causing blur too]. I''m searching for the signs of a shadow.The exposers seem different, the ground dark and the letter very bright. Anyhow, the background is distracting and takes attention off the main subject, the letter. Also, the whole picture could be a little sharper perhaps?', '2003-08-22 08:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(395779, 33624, 8522, '<td valign="top">Incredible... I look forward to seeing which camera (and user!) can produce this with no post-editing. Great smooth background, subject is nice and sharp. I like the blur on the blades. 10</td>', 'Incredible... I look forward to seeing which camera (and user!) can produce this with no post-editing. Great smooth background, subject is nice and sharp. I like the blur on the blades. 10', '2003-08-22 09:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(395783, 34469, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, great exposure, no noise in background! Lovely tones on the shoes. Effective lighting. Nice set-up. 8</td>', 'Wow, great exposure, no noise in background! Lovely tones on the shoes. Effective lighting. Nice set-up. 8', '2003-08-22 09:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(395785, 34105, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice handwriting, great lighting, good composition. Quality is good, your camera is sharp! Well exposed. 8</td>', 'Nice handwriting, great lighting, good composition. Quality is good, your camera is sharp! Well exposed. 8', '2003-08-22 09:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(395787, 33460, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, an interesting abstract. Great composition. Effective range of tones. 8</td>', 'Nice macro, an interesting abstract. Great composition. Effective range of tones. 8', '2003-08-22 09:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
