(396384, 33834, 9504, '<td valign="top">I think you had some good ideas here, but with the building being so dark, it is distracting.  I can''t quite make out what is in front of it -- and I find that distracting.    That oak tree in the back would have made an excellent photo.  It has incredible character and age -- and has a huge past... Damn, I should have taken a photo of my oak tree!</td>', 'I think you had some good ideas here, but with the building being so dark, it is distracting.  I can''t quite make out what is in front of it -- and I find that distracting.    That oak tree in the back would have made an excellent photo.  It has incredible character and age -- and has a huge past... Damn, I should have taken a photo of my oak tree!', '2003-08-22 16:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(396387, 34417, 9504, '<td valign="top">While you captured an old piece of equipment, I don''t see the past in it.  The picture lacks interest and doesn''t peek my curiosity.  It''s rather bland and uninteresting.</td>', 'While you captured an old piece of equipment, I don''t see the past in it.  The picture lacks interest and doesn''t peek my curiosity.  It''s rather bland and uninteresting.', '2003-08-22 16:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
