(396630, 33791, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good shot!  Sepia works well here.  It''s a pity we couldn''t edit, so that the picture would have a bit more contrast.  ~7</td>', 'Good shot!  Sepia works well here.  It''s a pity we couldn''t edit, so that the picture would have a bit more contrast.  ~7', '2003-08-22 19:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
