(396646, 34366, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good shot!  Good entry to the challenge.  I like the colours - the light is just right.  ~9</td>', 'Good shot!  Good entry to the challenge.  I like the colours - the light is just right.  ~9', '2003-08-22 19:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(396649, 33759, 5112, '<td valign="top">Recent past - interesting idea!  The colours of the sky are really threatening!  I like it how you got the house silhouette so dark.  Good work!</td>', 'Recent past - interesting idea!  The colours of the sky are really threatening!  I like it how you got the house silhouette so dark.  Good work!', '2003-08-22 19:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(396672, 34482, 3320, '<td valign="top">I think that if you are going to do a symmetric shoit, you should try the perfect symmetry.</td>', 'I think that if you are going to do a symmetric shoit, you should try the perfect symmetry.', '2003-08-22 20:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(396674, 34261, 3320, '<td valign="top">You should have lower the letter in the frame. Other than that I think the ''setup'' should be better. It looks like the letter has been dropped there for the picture.</td>', 'You should have lower the letter in the frame. Other than that I think the ''setup'' should be better. It looks like the letter has been dropped there for the picture.', '2003-08-22 20:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(396675, 34027, 11333, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the residential and the industrial!</td>', 'I like the contrast between the residential and the industrial!', '2003-08-22 20:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(396676, 34027, 3320, '<td valign="top">photo is way too busy and crowded. Depth of field control would help or a closer shot</td>', 'photo is way too busy and crowded. Depth of field control would help or a closer shot', '2003-08-22 20:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(396677, 34327, 3320, '<td valign="top">nice shot but in my opinion stretching the theme too much</td>', 'nice shot but in my opinion stretching the theme too much', '2003-08-22 20:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(396679, 33707, 3320, '<td valign="top">If you have almost 100%% of it .. then you should have it fully in the frame/ bottom part of the picture looks empty<br/></td>', 'If you have almost 100%% of it .. then you should have it fully in the frame/ bottom part of the picture looks empty', '2003-08-22 20:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(396681, 34205, 3320, '<td valign="top">sorry, but not really interesting</td>', 'sorry, but not really interesting', '2003-08-22 20:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(396683, 33406, 6870, '<td valign="top">Asking us to flip ourselves actually matches the camera''s operation! Except that we would have to turn it ALL the way over (180 degrees). Nice tones and good shot.</td>', 'Asking us to flip ourselves actually matches the camera''s operation! Except that we would have to turn it ALL the way over (180 degrees). Nice tones and good shot.', '2003-08-22 20:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(396684, 34504, 3320, '<td valign="top">good use of the sepia. maybe better with less DOF so the background would be a little blurry , but maybe your camera does not allow it.</td>', 'good use of the sepia. maybe better with less DOF so the background would be a little blurry , but maybe your camera does not allow it.', '2003-08-22 20:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(396686, 34496, 3320, '<td valign="top">stretching the theme. horizon line in the middle of the frame. sorry .. but ''just an other sunset''.</td>', 'stretching the theme. horizon line in the middle of the frame. sorry .. but ''just an other sunset''.', '2003-08-22 20:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(396687, 33579, 6870, '<td valign="top">Tones are perfect, which to me seems difficult with the no editing whatsoever rule. Wonderful composition and idea. Oddly, I can almost smell it, having been in many a miliking barn growing up! 10</td>', 'Tones are perfect, which to me seems difficult with the no editing whatsoever rule. Wonderful composition and idea. Oddly, I can almost smell it, having been in many a miliking barn growing up! 10', '2003-08-22 20:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(396689, 34486, 3320, '<td valign="top">You should have move closer !!! nothing interesting in the lower part and upper part. I would have increase the contrast. Yoou should have move to get a different point of view</td>', 'You should have move closer !!! nothing interesting in the lower part and upper part. I would have increase the contrast. Yoou should have move to get a different point of view', '2003-08-22 20:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(396690, 33791, 6870, '<td valign="top">Works. Tones are wonderful, and you''ve really captured that old photo look. 9</td>', 'Works. Tones are wonderful, and you''ve really captured that old photo look. 9', '2003-08-22 20:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(396692, 34193, 6870, '<td valign="top">Pretty model and nice perspective! Works.</td>', 'Pretty model and nice perspective! Works.', '2003-08-22 20:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(396708, 34430, 11184, '<td valign="top">Think it needs a little better backdrop that fits the mood of the camera and time period...or even just a solid background, because this background unfortunately claims too much of the attention away from the camera.</td>', 'Think it needs a little better backdrop that fits the mood of the camera and time period...or even just a solid background, because this background unfortunately claims too much of the attention away from the camera.', '2003-08-22 21:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(396712, 34275, 11184, '<td valign="top">Woah, that''s provacative.  Sure to stir up some controversy.   Definitely sets itself apart from most of the other photos in the challenge.  I like the whole "shadow" thing, but could use a little more subtley balanced shadow/lighting around the emblem.  Looks almost like a dark circle towards the top left of it which takes away from it quite a bit.</td>', 'Woah, that''s provacative.  Sure to stir up some controversy.   Definitely sets itself apart from most of the other photos in the challenge.  I like the whole "shadow" thing, but could use a little more subtley balanced shadow/lighting around the emblem.  Looks almost like a dark circle towards the top left of it which takes away from it quite a bit.', '2003-08-22 21:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(396724, 34114, 11184, '<td valign="top">Ha! .A posted secret, labeled "secret" on a bold background none the less.  Pssst, don''t tell.  If you go further I wonder if there are any "super duper" secret signs.  Now that would be a cool shot...if you could live to post it.  <br/>Normally I might try to make some comment about cropping out and blocking parts of the sign....but hey, since it''s a secret.</td>', 'Ha! .A posted secret, labeled "secret" on a bold background none the less.  Pssst, don''t tell.  If you go further I wonder if there are any "super duper" secret signs.  Now that would be a cool shot...if you could live to post it.  Normally I might try to make some comment about cropping out and blocking parts of the sign....but hey, since it''s a secret.', '2003-08-22 21:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(396728, 33624, 3554, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the soft lighting and placement of the cord.</td>', 'Great shot. I love the soft lighting and placement of the cord.', '2003-08-22 21:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(396733, 34477, 3554, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and focus. 10.</td>', 'Great lighting and focus. 10.', '2003-08-22 21:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(396734, 34105, 3554, '<td valign="top">Excellent submission for the challenge. I love the angle of the hand and pen, the text adds authenticity, the lamp is well placed. 10.</td>', 'Excellent submission for the challenge. I love the angle of the hand and pen, the text adds authenticity, the lamp is well placed. 10.', '2003-08-22 21:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(396736, 34431, 3554, '<td valign="top">The colors really make this shot feel authentic. DOF gives a sense of motion.</td>', 'The colors really make this shot feel authentic. DOF gives a sense of motion.', '2003-08-22 22:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(396737, 34153, 3554, '<td valign="top">I love how the edge curls up giving what would have been a flat shot 3 dimensions.</td>', 'I love how the edge curls up giving what would have been a flat shot 3 dimensions.', '2003-08-22 22:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(396738, 34504, 3554, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and exposure, nice color.</td>', 'Good lighting and exposure, nice color.', '2003-08-22 22:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(396740, 33839, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and angle of the ground in this shot.</td>', 'I like the DOF and angle of the ground in this shot.', '2003-08-22 22:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(396745, 34220, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of the lighting or angle of this shot. Also the edge of the table in the top right corner detracts from the shot.</td>', 'Not a big fan of the lighting or angle of this shot. Also the edge of the table in the top right corner detracts from the shot.', '2003-08-22 22:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(396749, 34418, 3554, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you were going for a soft light look or not, but this viewer''s impression is that it''s simply overexposed. I think if the subject wasn''t parrallel to the camera that would help. Maybe an angled shot from the left looking from back to frong would have been better. Might have tried this early in the morning or just before dusk for better lighting.</td>', 'I''m not sure if you were going for a soft light look or not, but this viewer''s impression is that it''s simply overexposed. I think if the subject wasn''t parrallel to the camera that would help. Maybe an angled shot from the left looking from back to frong would have been better. Might have tried this early in the morning or just before dusk for better lighting.', '2003-08-22 22:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(396750, 33590, 3554, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if the green striping is from the camera or just part of the stone.  Interesting lighting with the flare in the top left to the darker area in the bottom right.</td>', 'I can''t tell if the green striping is from the camera or just part of the stone.  Interesting lighting with the flare in the top left to the darker area in the bottom right.', '2003-08-22 22:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(396758, 34412, 11184, '<td valign="top">This might have been better arranged a little more naturally.  It is staged so neat and so linear.  Kinda boxy and too much just like reading a list like this, which detracts from the nice warm feel from the bugle and photo.  The tape goes against this too...seems to not fit well with the time, the mood, or the colors.  Maybe just the photo sitting diagonally with the bugle laying on its side across the top of it, like they were more naturally just set there.</td>', 'This might have been better arranged a little more naturally.  It is staged so neat and so linear.  Kinda boxy and too much just like reading a list like this, which detracts from the nice warm feel from the bugle and photo.  The tape goes against this too...seems to not fit well with the time, the mood, or the colors.  Maybe just the photo sitting diagonally with the bugle laying on its side across the top of it, like they were more naturally just set there.', '2003-08-22 22:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(396763, 34142, 11184, '<td valign="top">Some great vinyl.  Might work better with the cabinet left of the Hi-Fi cropped off...and above the back of the playing record...hate to lose too much of the Denver, but the reflection off that glass and the glimpse of the CD player kinda takes away from it a bit.</td>', 'Some great vinyl.  Might work better with the cabinet left of the Hi-Fi cropped off...and above the back of the playing record...hate to lose too much of the Denver, but the reflection off that glass and the glimpse of the CD player kinda takes away from it a bit.', '2003-08-22 22:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(396765, 34435, 11184, '<td valign="top">Its too bad for those dang railroad lights.  Well since ya can''t take those things down to easily maybe just try moving a litttle bit over to get that "Harper''s Ferry" a bit more centered between the posts and not crowded off as much at the left end, IF possible..</td>', 'Its too bad for those dang railroad lights.  Well since ya can''t take those things down to easily maybe just try moving a litttle bit over to get that "Harper''s Ferry" a bit more centered between the posts and not crowded off as much at the left end, IF possible..', '2003-08-22 22:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(396794, 34488, 11184, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  And shot to capture its warm and wonderful antiquity.  Some might complain about the lighting from the upper right and the shadows in the lower corners, but still a great shot and works fine.</td>', 'Beautiful.  And shot to capture its warm and wonderful antiquity.  Some might complain about the lighting from the upper right and the shadows in the lower corners, but still a great shot and works fine.', '2003-08-22 23:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(396803, 34281, 6477, '<td valign="top">I love this pic, the composition, the light and the colors are amazing. Just perfect. =10</td>', 'I love this pic, the composition, the light and the colors are amazing. Just perfect. =10', '2003-08-22 23:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(396806, 34473, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice shot, should have saved this for the Monument challenge.</td>', 'nice shot, should have saved this for the Monument challenge.', '2003-08-22 23:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(396809, 34431, 11126, '<td valign="top">I think who ever shot this must think like me. Good composition and a great subject as well.</td>', 'I think who ever shot this must think like me. Good composition and a great subject as well.', '2003-08-22 23:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(396810, 33819, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice shot, i like the composition, really accentuates the front end design of the truck.</td>', 'nice shot, i like the composition, really accentuates the front end design of the truck.', '2003-08-22 23:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(396811, 34434, 1280, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2003-08-22 23:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(396817, 34461, 4388, '<td valign="top">it looks like a modern representation of an old design.</td>', 'it looks like a modern representation of an old design.', '2003-08-22 23:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(396822, 33624, 1280, '<td valign="top">I love it!</td>', 'I love it!', '2003-08-22 23:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(396825, 34237, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice but the image is a little too dark.</td>', 'Nice but the image is a little too dark.', '2003-08-22 23:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(396826, 33590, 9854, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but I wish there were more to read.  As it is, I''m just dependent on the title to know what the picture''s about.</td>', 'Very nice, but I wish there were more to read.  As it is, I''m just dependent on the title to know what the picture''s about.', '2003-08-22 23:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(396828, 34114, 9854, '<td valign="top">How funny!  I guess if a *secret* is official, it has to be announced by signboards for the public to know. And what a bizarre secret that is :)</td>', 'How funny!  I guess if a *secret* is official, it has to be announced by signboards for the public to know. And what a bizarre secret that is :)', '2003-08-22 23:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(396829, 33739, 9854, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Can''t add more.</td>', 'Very nice. Can''t add more.', '2003-08-22 23:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(396831, 33579, 10768, '<td valign="top">Clear crisp image.  I like the color of the desaturation which you used to give it the "old" feeling.  It makes me wish I could see the rest of the room.  10</td>', 'Clear crisp image.  I like the color of the desaturation which you used to give it the "old" feeling.  It makes me wish I could see the rest of the room.  10', '2003-08-22 23:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(396833, 34366, 4388, '<td valign="top">this looks familiar, Plano Farmstead???</td>', 'this looks familiar, Plano Farmstead???', '2003-08-22 23:59:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(396834, 34447, 10768, '<td valign="top">I''m not exactly sure what this image is, but it''s a gorgeous shot.  Nice lighting and lines.  Very interesting to view. 9<br/></td>', 'I''m not exactly sure what this image is, but it''s a gorgeous shot.  Nice lighting and lines.  Very interesting to view. 9', '2003-08-23 00:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(396835, 34431, 10768, '<td valign="top">I like the way the arm of the record player wraps around your focal point drawing the eyes to the record label.  Nice colors.  Unique shot. 9</td>', 'I like the way the arm of the record player wraps around your focal point drawing the eyes to the record label.  Nice colors.  Unique shot. 9', '2003-08-23 00:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(396868, 34468, 3080, '<td valign="top">To be perfectly honest, this isn''t the most exciting shot I''ve seen.  Not really much to grab my attention.  I think that in person it might have some effect, but as a photo, it just doesn''t grab me.  However, I think that you did a nice job of taking this photo.  The lighting is good, no bright spots or distracting dark areas.  Focus appears to be just fine, and actually I think that the crack is a little more interesting than the drawing its self.  I might have prefered if the subject were off center a bit and not so centered.</td>', 'To be perfectly honest, this isn''t the most exciting shot I''ve seen.  Not really much to grab my attention.  I think that in person it might have some effect, but as a photo, it just doesn''t grab me.  However, I think that you did a nice job of taking this photo.  The lighting is good, no bright spots or distracting dark areas.  Focus appears to be just fine, and actually I think that the crack is a little more interesting than the drawing its self.  I might have prefered if the subject were off center a bit and not so centered.', '2003-08-23 01:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(396870, 33406, 2337, '<td valign="top">Extra point for following the rules!!!</td>', 'Extra point for following the rules!!!', '2003-08-23 01:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(396925, 33557, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the way we are looking up toward the top of the booth.  Not only does it make it interesting to look at, but it also leads our eye to what I feel is the oldest looking part of the booth.  The writing at the top.  Also, I like how the leaves are covering the door to the right of the photo.  I assume this is the door because this is where the hinges are.  This increases the oldness of the booth as well..  The colors are really good.  I think that the red/green combo is quite attractive.  The lighting is also good.  Focus and clarity good as well.  Overall a really nice shot.  No complaints from me. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like the way we are looking up toward the top of the booth.  Not only does it make it interesting to look at, but it also leads our eye to what I feel is the oldest looking part of the booth.  The writing at the top.  Also, I like how the leaves are covering the door to the right of the photo.  I assume this is the door because this is where the hinges are.  This increases the oldness of the booth as well..  The colors are really good.  I think that the red/green combo is quite attractive.  The lighting is also good.  Focus and clarity good as well.  Overall a really nice shot.  No complaints from me. ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(396934, 34193, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot.  I really love the focus and clarity.  I think that is what makes the shot for me.  You have a really beautiful model.  I think she did an excellent job with this shoot, and I bet she had fun with it as well.  Definately shows times gone by.  Black and white works wonderfully here.  I did see the DQ request on this one and saw the info you entered, and want to commend your model mostly for her age.  Wonderful.<br/>Also, commend you on the photo, this one stands out in the crowd to me.  I like the softness the DOF creates here.  The necklace being soft, and the veil being crisp really works for me.  The closeness is also great. Congrats on a great photo! ~Heather~</td>', 'This is an excellent shot.  I really love the focus and clarity.  I think that is what makes the shot for me.  You have a really beautiful model.  I think she did an excellent job with this shoot, and I bet she had fun with it as well.  Definately shows times gone by.  Black and white works wonderfully here.  I did see the DQ request on this one and saw the info you entered, and want to commend your model mostly for her age.  Wonderful.Also, commend you on the photo, this one stands out in the crowd to me.  I like the softness the DOF creates here.  The necklace being soft, and the veil being crisp really works for me.  The closeness is also great. Congrats on a great photo! ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 02:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(396938, 34469, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. Can''t wait to hear how you got such good contrast out of camera. I haven''t figured out how to do that.</td>', 'I like the composition. Can''t wait to hear how you got such good contrast out of camera. I haven''t figured out how to do that.', '2003-08-23 02:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(396940, 33406, 3554, '<td valign="top">Nice and fits the challenge well. Bonus points for following all the rules.</td>', 'Nice and fits the challenge well. Bonus points for following all the rules.', '2003-08-23 02:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(396942, 34111, 3080, '<td valign="top">The angle and framing/cropping of this shot are nice.  I do like the colors, but not of the sky.  Not really much you can do about that, but it still bothers me a bit.  Not really the most ideal sky for a wonderful subject like this.  I wish there weren''t people all over the shot, but another thing you really have no control over.  your focus and clarity are really good, and I think that the rest of the shot works for me as well.  You did a nice job of leveling your far water horizon.  This is something that bothers me to no end, and you did a great job.  ~Heather~</td>', 'The angle and framing/cropping of this shot are nice.  I do like the colors, but not of the sky.  Not really much you can do about that, but it still bothers me a bit.  Not really the most ideal sky for a wonderful subject like this.  I wish there weren''t people all over the shot, but another thing you really have no control over.  your focus and clarity are really good, and I think that the rest of the shot works for me as well.  You did a nice job of leveling your far water horizon.  This is something that bothers me to no end, and you did a great job.  ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 02:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(396943, 33656, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot. A flannel shirt or aviater''s jacket hanging off the back of one of the chairs would make it feel more authentic. Something to help it feel someone was just there.</td>', 'I like it a lot. A flannel shirt or aviater''s jacket hanging off the back of one of the chairs would make it feel more authentic. Something to help it feel someone was just there.', '2003-08-23 02:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(396944, 34284, 3554, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting and focus problems hurt this shot. Also I''m not sure what all the stuff in the front of the wagon is...</td>', 'Poor lighting and focus problems hurt this shot. Also I''m not sure what all the stuff in the front of the wagon is...', '2003-08-23 02:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(396945, 33761, 3554, '<td valign="top">Two challenges in a row we''ve had blank black "shots."  It was funnier the first time...</td>', 'Two challenges in a row we''ve had blank black "shots."  It was funnier the first time...', '2003-08-23 02:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(396946, 34461, 3080, '<td valign="top">This would work in an abstract category for me.  I''m not really sure this grabs my attention much.  Not much distinction between the darkness and the wheels.  the angle is interesting, but maybe not my personal preference.  I would much like to have seen a larger portion of this car if it was available.  I''m not really sure why we''re UNDER the car, looking up, but i supose it makes us think.  the bumper is distracting to me, not that that is your fault, but it doesn''t seem to fit with the elegance of the rest of the vehicle.  Overall technically, I think you did good with the focus and clarity and the color looks to be good as well.  Just not really my kind of shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'This would work in an abstract category for me.  I''m not really sure this grabs my attention much.  Not much distinction between the darkness and the wheels.  the angle is interesting, but maybe not my personal preference.  I would much like to have seen a larger portion of this car if it was available.  I''m not really sure why we''re UNDER the car, looking up, but i supose it makes us think.  the bumper is distracting to me, not that that is your fault, but it doesn''t seem to fit with the elegance of the rest of the vehicle.  Overall technically, I think you did good with the focus and clarity and the color looks to be good as well.  Just not really my kind of shot. ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 02:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(396947, 34505, 3554, '<td valign="top">The lighting and angle of this picture are unflattering. Cute concept but work on the execution. Maybe try lining them up and playing with the DOF so the most recent (or least recent) shoes are in focus while the other''s aren''t. Even grass in outdoor lighting might have helped.</td>', 'The lighting and angle of this picture are unflattering. Cute concept but work on the execution. Maybe try lining them up and playing with the DOF so the most recent (or least recent) shoes are in focus while the other''s aren''t. Even grass in outdoor lighting might have helped.', '2003-08-23 02:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(396948, 34237, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the lighting in this one. Also the printing on the window to the left of the lamp doesn''t really belong. More light on the foreground and a blurred background would help this out.</td>', 'Not a fan of the lighting in this one. Also the printing on the window to the left of the lamp doesn''t really belong. More light on the foreground and a blurred background would help this out.', '2003-08-23 02:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(396949, 34468, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the subject but the lighting is dull and makes this shot lifeless. Perhaps taking it at a differnt time of day would have helped?</td>', 'I like the subject but the lighting is dull and makes this shot lifeless. Perhaps taking it at a differnt time of day would have helped?', '2003-08-23 02:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(396950, 34447, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a very clear, crisp photo.  I think you did an excellent job with the focus here.  The lighting is also a large benefit to your photo, as I think it enhances the colors and focus.  I think that the little patches of blue poking through the photo really add some interest to the shot, although not a direct interest, had the entire photo been all tan, I think it would have been a bit of a boring shot, so the blue is a definate plus to the shot.  Great angle and framing/cropping.  I think this is an excellent shot, not much to complain about here.  Good one. ~Heather~</td>', 'This is a very clear, crisp photo.  I think you did an excellent job with the focus here.  The lighting is also a large benefit to your photo, as I think it enhances the colors and focus.  I think that the little patches of blue poking through the photo really add some interest to the shot, although not a direct interest, had the entire photo been all tan, I think it would have been a bit of a boring shot, so the blue is a definate plus to the shot.  Great angle and framing/cropping.  I think this is an excellent shot, not much to complain about here.  Good one. ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 02:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(396951, 34440, 3080, '<td valign="top">To me, this photo is too much of the same color.  I know this sounds strange, but I think that the axe almost dissapears into the background.  The shirt is pink, when my mind wants it to be white.  The jeans almost get lost into the background as well.  I think that I would like a bit more tones.  Not really sure if that''s possible inside your camera, but definately when the challenge is done and over with, I hope you are able to edit in a larger variety of tones.  As for the challenge, I think it fits nicely.  Definately looks older, and I like the clothing as well as I think that adds to the oldness feeling of the photo.  Overall a nice shot, just got some color issues in my personal opinion. ~Heather~</td>', 'To me, this photo is too much of the same color.  I know this sounds strange, but I think that the axe almost dissapears into the background.  The shirt is pink, when my mind wants it to be white.  The jeans almost get lost into the background as well.  I think that I would like a bit more tones.  Not really sure if that''s possible inside your camera, but definately when the challenge is done and over with, I hope you are able to edit in a larger variety of tones.  As for the challenge, I think it fits nicely.  Definately looks older, and I like the clothing as well as I think that adds to the oldness feeling of the photo.  Overall a nice shot, just got some color issues in my personal opinion. ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 02:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(396952, 34477, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your focus doesn''t seem to be quite in the right place in my personal opinion.  I think I would like for it to be a little bit lower, to show more of the SU deffinition in focus.  Right now, the def. above is more in focus.  I mean, you can still read it, but it''s kind of annoying.  The color is good, and I like the tilt of the photo.  The angle and fill the frame framing are nice.  Focus is really nice, but to me, in the wrong place.  Overall nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'Your focus doesn''t seem to be quite in the right place in my personal opinion.  I think I would like for it to be a little bit lower, to show more of the SU deffinition in focus.  Right now, the def. above is more in focus.  I mean, you can still read it, but it''s kind of annoying.  The color is good, and I like the tilt of the photo.  The angle and fill the frame framing are nice.  Focus is really nice, but to me, in the wrong place.  Overall nice. ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 02:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(396953, 34105, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  As this loaded from top to bottom, I was thinking "What kind of pen is he writing with" when the full photo loaded, I was pleased to see.  You put some thought into this shot, and I think that it shows.  Focus and clarity are just awesome.  Really nice job. The angle and framing/cropping are perfect in my opinion.  Nice tones, and the lamp adds to the shot as well.  One of my favorites so far. ~Heather~</td>', 'Wonderful.  As this loaded from top to bottom, I was thinking "What kind of pen is he writing with" when the full photo loaded, I was pleased to see.  You put some thought into this shot, and I think that it shows.  Focus and clarity are just awesome.  Really nice job. The angle and framing/cropping are perfect in my opinion.  Nice tones, and the lamp adds to the shot as well.  One of my favorites so far. ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 02:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(396955, 34451, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think the title would work better had this photo actually been black and white.  I realize that not all camera''s have that feature, so maybe not possible, but just curious about the title.  These definately look like old boats, and your focus is good in my opinion.  I think the colors seem a bit muted.  Mabye it''s just the shadow from the white boat on the green one that bothers me a bit.  Also, I wish you could have gotten the back end of the white boat in the shot, it seems a bit off balance with the white boat standing out so well, and the green boat is almost invisible as it blends in with the background.  It''s kind of weighed down on the left of the photo.  Definately old though.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I think the title would work better had this photo actually been black and white.  I realize that not all camera''s have that feature, so maybe not possible, but just curious about the title.  These definately look like old boats, and your focus is good in my opinion.  I think the colors seem a bit muted.  Mabye it''s just the shadow from the white boat on the green one that bothers me a bit.  Also, I wish you could have gotten the back end of the white boat in the shot, it seems a bit off balance with the white boat standing out so well, and the green boat is almost invisible as it blends in with the background.  It''s kind of weighed down on the left of the photo.  Definately old though.  ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 02:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(396956, 33834, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually fond of IR photography and this is no exception.  I don''t think it really works here.  The building lacks detail.  I think it''s just too dark to really see much.  Maybe it''s not even that it''s ''dark'' but it''s cloudy.  Something is making the building dull.  The main focus seems to be on the tree, and that really doesn''t screem ''the past'' to me.  The building looks old, but it''s not really the most ''interesting'' part of the photo, as the eyes are drawn to the unusual muddy brown sky and white tree.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m not usually fond of IR photography and this is no exception.  I don''t think it really works here.  The building lacks detail.  I think it''s just too dark to really see much.  Maybe it''s not even that it''s ''dark'' but it''s cloudy.  Something is making the building dull.  The main focus seems to be on the tree, and that really doesn''t screem ''the past'' to me.  The building looks old, but it''s not really the most ''interesting'' part of the photo, as the eyes are drawn to the unusual muddy brown sky and white tree.  ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 02:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(396958, 34135, 3080, '<td valign="top">I supose anything that''s not the present is in fact "the past" but this doesn''t appear to me as being very much in the past. I mean, I can see the plaque which I assume says something about being a historical monument of some sort, but the building its self doesn''t look very old at all.  What ever that is on the steps is distracting, as my eyes are drawn to it''s brightness and I sit here trying to figure out what the heck would be sitting on the steps like this.  Your focus and clarity are good, and for the most part lighting is alright as well.  Some shadows, but none bad on the building itself.  The angle is odd, like you are looking at it from the side, but not enough to be dramatic.  Kind of looks like you were only a step or 2 off from being in front of it.  Also, the darkness on the left of the photo doesn''t add anything to me.  I think that it''s not really important and could be cropped out without losing anything from your image.  Overall, I think it''s good though. ~Heather~</td>', 'I supose anything that''s not the present is in fact "the past" but this doesn''t appear to me as being very much in the past. I mean, I can see the plaque which I assume says something about being a historical monument of some sort, but the building its self doesn''t look very old at all.  What ever that is on the steps is distracting, as my eyes are drawn to it''s brightness and I sit here trying to figure out what the heck would be sitting on the steps like this.  Your focus and clarity are good, and for the most part lighting is alright as well.  Some shadows, but none bad on the building itself.  The angle is odd, like you are looking at it from the side, but not enough to be dramatic.  Kind of looks like you were only a step or 2 off from being in front of it.  Also, the darkness on the left of the photo doesn''t add anything to me.  I think that it''s not really important and could be cropped out without losing anything from your image.  Overall, I think it''s good though. ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 02:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(396969, 34193, 6888, '<td valign="top">composition is good, focus is good, there is a lot of expression in the look on her face, this is very well done</td>', 'composition is good, focus is good, there is a lot of expression in the look on her face, this is very well done', '2003-08-23 03:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
