(397149, 34434, 3080, '<td valign="top">The colors here are stunning.  This has a bit of a "not real" feel to it.  Kind of like it was a little model or something.  I can tell it''s not, but it just seems kind of dreamy.  Not quite sure I explained that right, but not really sure how to explain it.<br/>Anyway, your focus and clarity are awesome for being straight out of the camera with no adjustments.  Definately shows a time from the past, and the angle and framing/cropping are really nice. I like how you have put the wagon off to the right a bit. ~Heather~</td>', 'The colors here are stunning.  This has a bit of a "not real" feel to it.  Kind of like it was a little model or something.  I can tell it''s not, but it just seems kind of dreamy.  Not quite sure I explained that right, but not really sure how to explain it.Anyway, your focus and clarity are awesome for being straight out of the camera with no adjustments.  Definately shows a time from the past, and the angle and framing/cropping are really nice. I like how you have put the wagon off to the right a bit. ~Heather~', '2003-08-23 13:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(397151, 33685, 92, '<td valign="top">I love the title :)  This is sadly a thing of the past. Living in a small town it was the only way things use to be. The drugist would be happy to give you a few meds on your out of date/ no refill  prescription on a weekend until you could see your doctor on Monday. Now new chain drug stores are filling every corner. This fits the challenge to a "T" . GREAT angle and composition. Good luck !</td>', 'I love the title :)  This is sadly a thing of the past. Living in a small town it was the only way things use to be. The drugist would be happy to give you a few meds on your out of date/ no refill  prescription on a weekend until you could see your doctor on Monday. Now new chain drug stores are filling every corner. This fits the challenge to a "T" . GREAT angle and composition. Good luck !', '2003-08-23 13:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
