(399293, 34231, 2000, '<td valign="top">I think you made this pic too small.  The max size is 640 on one or both sides, and max file size is 150k... this pic is 32k, at 400x300 - too small with not enough resolution.  Even a 1mp camera will take a shot that can be fairly good at 150k.  However, the train is a good subject for the challenge.</td>', 'I think you made this pic too small.  The max size is 640 on one or both sides, and max file size is 150k... this pic is 32k, at 400x300 - too small with not enough resolution.  Even a 1mp camera will take a shot that can be fairly good at 150k.  However, the train is a good subject for the challenge.', '2003-08-25 23:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
