(402623, 34275, 9411, '<td valign="top">Thank you all so much....<br/> <br/>Well, sure I''d like a ribbon some day... at least now I''m getting things in focus!  "OH,, that''s what that little dial is for!"" &lt;G&gt;<br/> <br/>Kidding aside, this is a very hard subject to bring up and I''m so pleased peopele were able to vote on the image and how it made them feel and not just go by it because they didn''t want to look.<br/> <br/>With out being able to edit I spent 2 days trying to get it just right.<br/>I lost count of the number of shots I took at around 100.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-28 10:27:39.</i></td>', 'Thank you all so much.... Well, sure I''d like a ribbon some day... at least now I''m getting things in focus!  "OH,, that''s what that little dial is for!"" <G> Kidding aside, this is a very hard subject to bring up and I''m so pleased peopele were able to vote on the image and how it made them feel and not just go by it because they didn''t want to look. With out being able to edit I spent 2 days trying to get it just right.I lost count of the number of shots I took at around 100.', '2003-08-28 11:26:41.000000', '2003-08-28 11:27:39.000000', 0),
