(404817, 33495, 2427, '<td valign="top">great mood.  Very empty.  I like.  Thank you.</td>', 'great mood.  Very empty.  I like.  Thank you.', '2003-08-30 19:29:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(404967, 34486, 8367, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and comments. I appreciate the input.<br/>This is our 1951 John Deere tractor going uphill(the fence posts on the right are level and true to the horizon). I thought it looked like the past because of the surroundings and age of the tractor. I was standing on the second from the top fence rail to get the shot because I wanted to show the hill in the foreground and to be looking down on the horses instead of up at their behinds! <br/>I enjoyed framing the shot the way I wanted it...instead of cropping after the fact. Good Challenge!<br/>I am not sure that I understand a couple of the comments.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for the votes and comments. I appreciate the input.This is our 1951 John Deere tractor going uphill(the fence posts on the right are level and true to the horizon). I thought it looked like the past because of the surroundings and age of the tractor. I was standing on the second from the top fence rail to get the shot because I wanted to show the hill in the foreground and to be looking down on the horses instead of up at their behinds! I enjoyed framing the shot the way I wanted it...instead of cropping after the fact. Good Challenge!I am not sure that I understand a couple of the comments.', '2003-08-30 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(405035, 33684, 5318, '<td valign="top">The Windmill Railroad lantern... I haven''t seen those in years,where on Earth did you find that!!!   Nicly done B/W, perfect!!</td>', 'The Windmill Railroad lantern... I haven''t seen those in years,where on Earth did you find that!!!   Nicly done B/W, perfect!!', '2003-08-31 03:45:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(405037, 33684, 10084, '<td valign="top">You guys related Mikefo and Sonifo :)<br/> <br/>Good composition. The monochrome color gives the picture a beautiful rustic look. A bit more contrast would give the shot more depth of field and the lantern would really pop out of the scene. Blurring the wall behind it just a tiny bit would also work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-31 04:04:37.</i></td>', 'You guys related Mikefo and Sonifo :) Good composition. The monochrome color gives the picture a beautiful rustic look. A bit more contrast would give the shot more depth of field and the lantern would really pop out of the scene. Blurring the wall behind it just a tiny bit would also work.', '2003-08-31 04:01:58.000000', '2003-08-31 05:04:37.000000', 0),
