(406854, 33860, 1647, '<td valign="top">I really like the close cropping used in this shot.  I would have liked to see a little more of the handmade gun and horn though - you spoke about them lot''s but they don''t grab my attention in the photo.  The colour is great and the background is good.  Using an older subject definitely helps meet the subject "The Past".</td>', 'I really like the close cropping used in this shot.  I would have liked to see a little more of the handmade gun and horn though - you spoke about them lot''s but they don''t grab my attention in the photo.  The colour is great and the background is good.  Using an older subject definitely helps meet the subject "The Past".', '2003-09-02 02:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
